    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giishealda uurda sugoocheanda Misri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba damwanagi, bea sheeda madeeda, eaweeda ispwa bea sheeda, hean goobaloolan ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea orjeeda siida, neahirji geatinda Farao was sugoocheanda Misri, ng'ula, miyearat nea geayiin meajooda, miyeeneawsa weasta, gideaba ghwanyas uurda jea ghoang'waanya ng'uta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ng'ula, aniini geawooschi haweewa Farao, was sugoocheanda Misri. Ak gaydahirja geatingaaschi sean dea majeek ea diita ghayi giinyean, ak gaydanung' goobissa ng'eanyi ng'uta mida geatindaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydaadabwaarda fuga Misri gaweay jeeda eemoojiga, nea ghaadabwaardi gaweay jeeda darooraka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydanung' ghwanyas uurda geatinga sugoocheanda Babeli, ak ghaayiinyi ng'uteanyu geatindaanyi, nea geatinga Farao gaydahirja. Ak gaygwatikan aba madeadaanyi, gaygwatkanda siida sisawana muuchi aba deaneadeeda jea ghabwar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydeamajeek geatinga sugoocheanda Babeli, nea geatinga Farao gaygang'arng'ariidi. Ak gajeanal gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA, inyas ghaayiinyi ng'uteanyu geatinda sugoocheanda Babeli, ak abeeda gayghamiinda geatindaanyi googeal ng'eanyiida Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydaadaarda fuga Misri gaweay jeeda eemoojiga, nea ghaanung' gwadarsa jeeda darooraka, ak gayghwanal gideaba geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
